---
description: Export, queue, gated publish. No password login bots.
alwaysApply: true
---

Findings and charts export to JSONL/CSV/PNG/SVG on disk.

Public posts, replies, comments:

- Official APIs only.
- Tokens from environment variables the operator sets. Never write tokens into the repo.
- Default action is draft into `queue/`.
- Network post requires an explicit publish flag plus `AZBOT_PUBLISH=1`.
- Do not implement browser password login.
- Do not scrape authenticated pages by stealing a session.
- Do not create scheduled posts unless the operator provided the exact text and cadence.
